16:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Technicians do most of the work of filling a prescription. What they may not do is exercise professional judgment about a patient's therapy — and that boundary holds regardless of how experienced you are or how obvious the answer seems. The final check on every prescription belongs to a pharmacist."}]
